                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Illustrative 1995 US Force Structure</hi>. Assuming no
                    radical reorientation of US strategic forces toward a less MIRVed force, US
                    levels would be driven primarily by the 4500/6000 weapons ceilings. Resulting US
                    launcher levels could be so low as to fit under all three sets of end-1995 SNDV
