                <p>Relaxing the SNDV ceilings would allow us to deploy a few more single RV systems,
                    but unless we were prepared to deploy single-RV missiles in place of Trident, MX
                    or ALCM heavy bombers, the RV and RV+ALCM ceilings would severely constrain our
                    ability to take advantage of the higher SNDV levels.</p>
